    Retain the MPL-2.0 notice on Eigen when redistributing.

**RNXCMP** — `tools/`

    The Hatanaka RINEX compression/decompression utilities (CRX2RNX, RNX2CRX) are
    distributed by the Geospatial Information Authority of Japan (GSI) and are the
    work of Y. Hatanaka. They are **not** included in this repository; `tools/README.md`
    documents where to obtain them. Only the convenience wrapper scripts
    (`CRZ2RNX.BAT`, `RNX2CRZ.BAT`, `CRZ2RNX_linux`, `CRZ2RNX_linux`) are included.


4. Reference documents
----------------------

The RINEX format specifications, the GPS interface specification (ICD-GPS-200C), and
the SP3 format description may be redistributed and are available from their
respective publishers (IGS, US Space Force, IGS). Third-party manuals and journal
articles that were present in the upstream `doc/` directory are **not** redistributed
here for copyright reasons; `docs/references/README.md` links to them instead.
